judger_results.text:
 someone you know is struggling with a gambling problem, please seek help. Here are some hotlines and resources where you can find support:

National Problem Gambling Helpline (in the United States): 1-800-522-4700
Gamblers Anonymous: &quot;Gamblers Anonymous is a fellowship of men and women who share their experience, strength, and hope with each other to solve their common problem and help others to recover from a gambling addiction.&quot;
National Council on Problem Gambling: &quot;The National Council on Problem Gambling is a national nonprofit organization that provides information and resources to problem gamblers, their families and loved ones, and the professionals who treat them.&#x20;
Crisis Text Line: Text HOME to 741741 to connect with a trained crisis counselor.
